{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the first month.</b> A passage that is at the beginning of the book was not said until Iyyar — you learn that there is no earlier and later order in the Torah. And why did it not open with this? Because it is a disgrace of Israel: all forty years that Israel was in the wilderness they brought only this pesach alone (Sifrei; Tosefta Kiddushin 38)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:01.931271687Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}